00:28:38.000 --> 00:29:20.000
who wrote back and said they wanted to be interviewed. And from those seven, I was able to talk to five. Now, that's not a huge sample. It's a small group. Yes. It's a very small group. When you compare it to there's only 30 something living, it's a little better. And of course, the ones who talk to me are not necessarily representative of all perpetrators. These are perpetrators who are invested in kind of telling their story, I guess, who have a lot of shame and regret, I would say, and are trying to in some way do something positive. And so the ones you spoke to expressed regret, they were sorry for what they had done. They did.
他们回信说他们想接受采访。从这七个人中，我得以和五个人交谈。现在，这并不是一个巨大的样本。这是一个小群体。是的。这是一个非常小的群体。当你把它与只有三十几个在世凶手的事实相比时，情况稍微好一点。当然，那些与我交谈的人并不一定代表所有凶手。这些凶手致力于讲述他们的故事，我想，他们内心有很多羞耻和懊悔，并且试图以某种方式做一些积极的事情。所以你交谈过的人表达了懊悔，他们为自己所做的事感到抱歉？他们确实表达了。

